WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.834
Cannabis is being built as money for useful computing, connecting requesters

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:07.320
who need services with providers who earn for accepted delivery.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:12.315
Each provider offer specifies the service, price, availability and delivery terms.

00:00:12.315 --> 00:00:16.949
The reservation system must prevent overbooking, while protected workers return encrypted

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:20.320
results for your client to verify and assemble.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:25.079
The founder receives one percent of accepted payments. Service backing requires

00:00:25.079 --> 00:00:29.537
available capacity and fulfilled provider commitments. These integrations are being prepared,

00:00:29.537 --> 00:00:32.780
and you can help develop the economic design.
